<title>UK: BOE forecasts 2.3 bln stg shortage, offers help.</title>
<headline>BOE forecasts 2.3 bln stg shortage, offers help.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England offered the UK money market an early round of assistance after forecasting a liquidity shortage of around 2.3 billion stg.</p>
<p>The operations will comprise repos to May 13, 14 and 15 and outright offers of bills maturing on or before May 15.</p>
</text>
